#: education/education/doctype/education_settings/education_settings.json:142
msgid ""
"By default, Sales Invoice will be created against Course Enrollment / Fee Schedule.\n"
"If enabled Sales Order will be created"
msgstr "De forma predeterminada, se crea una factura de venta a partir de la matrícula en el curso o del calendario de cobros.\nSi activa esta opción, se creará un pedido de venta."

#. Description of the 'Skip User creation for new Student' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Education Settings'
#: education/education/doctype/education_settings/education_settings.json:74
msgid "By default, a new User is created for every new Student. If enabled, no new User will be created when a new Student is created."
msgstr "De forma predeterminada, se crea una cuenta de usuario para cada estudiante nuevo. Si activa esta opción, no se creará dicha cuenta al registrar al estudiante."

#. Description of the 'Submit Sales Invoice from Course Enrollment / Fee
#. Schedule' (Check) field in DocType 'Education Settings'
#: education/education/doctype/education_settings/education_settings.json:82
msgid "By default, the Sales Invoice Created will be in Draft Mode. If enabled, the Sales Invoice will be submitted once created."
msgstr "De forma predeterminada, la factura de venta se crea como borrador. Si activa esta opción, se confirmará al crearla."

#. Description of the 'Sales Invoice Posting Date should be same as Fee
#. Schedule Posting Date' (Check) field in DocType 'Education Settings'
#: education/education/doctype/education_settings/education_settings.json:126
msgid "By default, the Sales Invoice's  Posting Date will be equal to Fee Schedule's Posting Date. If disabled then Sales Invoice's Posting Date will be today's date."
msgstr "De forma predeterminada, la factura de venta usa la fecha de contabilización del calendario de cobros. Si desactiva esta opción, se usará la fecha de hoy."

#. Description of the 'Submit Sales Order from Course Enrollment / Fee
#. Schedule' (Check) field in DocType 'Education Settings'
#: education/education/doctype/education_settings/education_settings.json:150
msgid "By default, the Sales Order Created will be in Draft Mode. If enabled, the Sales Order will be submitted once created."
msgstr "De forma predeterminada, el pedido de venta se crea como borrador. Si activa esta opción, se confirmará al crearlo."

#. Description of the 'Sales Order Posting Date should be same as Fee Schedule
#. Posting Date' (Check) field in DocType 'Education Settings'
#: education/education/doctype/education_settings/education_settings.json:158
msgid "By default, the Sales Order's  Transaction Date will be equal to Fee Schedule's Transaction Date. If disabled then Sales Order's Transaction Date will be today's date."
msgstr "De forma predeterminada, el pedido de venta usa la fecha de transacción del calendario de cobros. Si desactiva esta opción, se usará la fecha de hoy."

